Package: sta310r
Title: Data Sets and Computer Exercises for the STA310 Survival Analysis Course
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Erik", "Bülow", , "eriklgb@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The data sets that accompany Collett (2023), "Modelling Survival
    Data in Medical Research" (4th edition), documented for the STA310 course at
    the University of Gothenburg, together with the computer exercises used in
    the course. The package focuses on the data sets, their documentation and
    the exercise vignettes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/eribul/sta310r,
    https://eribul.github.io/sta310r/
Encoding: UTF-8
